sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant GW as Kubeflow Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant MR as model-registry-service<br/>8080/TCP Istio mTLS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Job as async-upload-job<br/>Python K8s Job
    participant S3 as S3/OCI Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Sig as Sigstore<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService CRD
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Ctrl as inference-service-controller
    participant CSI as storage-initializer
    participant Cat as model-catalog<br/>8080/TCP Istio mTLS
    participant CatDB as Catalog PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Sig: Flow 1: Model Registration and Artifact Upload

    User->>GW: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>Auth: OAuth2/kubeflow-userid
    GW->>MR: Forward (Istio mTLS)<br/>AuthorizationPolicy
    MR->>DB: INSERT registered_model<br/>Auth: Username/Password
    DB-->>MR: Model ID
    MR-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>User: RegisteredModel response

    User->>GW: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/model_versions<br/>Auth: OAuth2/kubeflow-userid
    GW->>MR: Forward (Istio mTLS)
    MR->>DB: INSERT model_version
    DB-->>MR: Version ID
    MR-->>GW: 201 Created
    GW-->>User: ModelVersion response

    Note over Job,Sig: Async Upload (K8s Job)
    Job->>MR: GET model artifact metadata<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer token
    MR-->>Job: Artifact URI + metadata
    Job->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM/Docker creds
    S3-->>Job: Model files
    Job->>Sig: Sign model (Fulcio + Rekor)<br/>HTTPS/443, OIDC token
    Sig-->>Job: Signature + transparency log entry
    Job->>S3: Upload signed model<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM/Docker creds
    S3-->>Job: Upload confirmation
    Job->>MR: PATCH artifact (update URI + signature)<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer token
    MR->>DB: UPDATE artifact
    MR-->>Job: Updated artifact

    Note over KServe,Ctrl: Flow 2: InferenceService Synchronization

    KServe->>K8s: Create InferenceService CR<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8s-->>Ctrl: Watch event (InferenceService created)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    Ctrl->>K8s: GET Services (label: component=model-registry)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    K8s-->>Ctrl: model-registry-service endpoint
    Ctrl->>MR: GET/POST serving_environments, inference_services<br/>HTTP/8080, Bearer token (optional)
    MR->>DB: UPSERT serving_environment + inference_service
    DB-->>MR: Confirmation
    MR-->>Ctrl: InferenceService synced
    Ctrl->>K8s: PATCH InferenceService (add labels)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token

    Note over CSI,S3: Flow 3: Model Download via CSI

    KServe->>CSI: Resolve model-registry://name?version=v1&namespace=ns
    CSI->>MR: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/artifacts<br/>HTTP/8080
    MR->>DB: SELECT artifact by model+version
    DB-->>MR: Artifact URI (s3://bucket/model)
    MR-->>CSI: ModelArtifact with storage URI
    CSI->>CSI: Validate URI (block 169.254.169.254)
    CSI->>S3: Download model via KServe provider<br/>HTTPS/443, Provider-specific auth
    S3-->>CSI: Model files

    Note over Cat,HF: Catalog Sync (Background)

    Cat->>CatDB: Acquire pglock (leader election)<br/>TCP/5432
    CatDB-->>Cat: Lock acquired (leader)
    Cat->>HF: GET model metadata<br/>HTTPS/443, HF_API_KEY Bearer
    HF-->>Cat: Model catalog data
    Cat->>CatDB: UPSERT catalog entries<br/>TCP/5432
    CatDB-->>Cat: Sync complete
